                ["Main enemy", "Waste (muda), unevenness (mura) and overburden (muri)", "Variation and the defects it produces"],
                ["Origin", "Toyota Production System; the word lean was coined by John Krafcik in 1988", "Motorola, 1986; scaled up by General Electric from 1995"],
