            "The table describes emphasis, not exclusive ownership. Lean teams use Pareto charts and the 5 whys; Six Sigma teams map processes and remove waste. The American Society for Quality (ASQ) notes that the line between the two has blurred, which is why many organisations now talk only about Lean Six Sigma.",
